WEBVTT

00:00:16.432 --> 00:00:17.552
(SNORING)

00:00:34.552 --> 00:00:35.792
(JESSIE GASPS)

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.672
Let's see. Hawaiian surf trunks.

00:00:42.152 --> 00:00:44.552
Oh! Barbie! Those were vintage!

00:00:44.632 --> 00:00:46.472
It's okay. All right, go ahead,
rip 'em, I don't care.

00:00:46.552 --> 00:00:47.632
They're a dime a dozen.

00:00:47.752 --> 00:00:49.472
Ooh, glitter tux.

00:00:49.552 --> 00:00:50.992
(EXCLAIMING)

00:00:51.072 --> 00:00:54.312
Who cares? Who cares?
Sequins are tacky. Who cares?

00:00:54.392 --> 00:00:56.552
Oh! A Nehru jacket.

00:00:56.832 --> 00:00:58.232
(GASPS) Barbie! Not the Nehru.

00:00:58.312 --> 00:01:00.992
This is from what, 1967?

00:01:01.072 --> 00:01:02.712
The groovy formal collection, yes!

00:01:02.992 --> 00:01:06.512
-What a shame.
-Oh, no, no, no! No!

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.152
There's an instruction manual!

00:01:08.232 --> 00:01:09.512
(EXCLAIMING)

00:01:09.592 --> 00:01:11.992
Lotso switched Buzz to Demo mode!

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.192
(SOBBING)

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:14.912
Where's that manual?

00:01:15.232 --> 00:01:16.272
(SIGHS)

00:01:16.352 --> 00:01:18.512
I don't know why this couldn't wait
until morning, Ken,

00:01:18.592 --> 00:01:20.592
but here you go.

00:01:31.552 --> 00:01:32.712
Eesh.

00:01:33.672 --> 00:01:35.352
What's takin' so doggone long?

00:01:35.432 --> 00:01:36.912
(KNOCK AT DOOR)

00:01:40.192 --> 00:01:41.712
So how do we fix Buzz?

00:01:55.112 --> 00:01:56.312
(GASPS)

00:01:58.552 --> 00:01:59.552
(COOING)

00:01:59.632 --> 00:02:01.112
What are you looking at, feathers?

00:02:03.392 --> 00:02:04.432
Hey! Ow!

00:02:06.152 --> 00:02:07.312
(GRUNTING)

00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:09.992
(EXCLAIMS)

00:02:10.072 --> 00:02:11.592
Yeah, fly away, you coward.

00:02:12.312 --> 00:02:13.472
Uh-oh.

00:02:14.752 --> 00:02:16.752
Well, that's just great.

00:02:22.992 --> 00:02:24.192
(MUFFLED) Help! Prison riot!

00:02:24.632 --> 00:02:26.512
-Mayday! Mayday!
-Oh, give it up. No one can hear you.

00:02:27.072 --> 00:02:29.992
-What?
-I said, "No one can hear you."

00:02:30.792 --> 00:02:32.912
-What?
-(LOUDLY) He said, "No one can..."

00:02:32.992 --> 00:02:34.792
HAMM: Shush! Will you be quiet?

00:02:35.312 --> 00:02:36.352
Woody! You're back!

00:02:37.992 --> 00:02:39.312
(HAMM AND REX EXCLAIMING)

00:02:40.312 --> 00:02:41.592
Stop him! Don't let him get out!

00:02:41.672 --> 00:02:44.672
Star Command! I've been
taken hostage by my own prisoners.

00:02:46.752 --> 00:02:48.512
Quick! Open his back.
There's a switch!

00:02:48.632 --> 00:02:50.192
Unhand me, Zurg scum!

00:02:50.432 --> 00:02:52.872
The Galactic Courts
will show you no mercy.

00:02:53.952 --> 00:02:56.592
It's not working. Why is it not working?
Where's the manual?

00:02:56.992 --> 00:02:59.112
Here we go! There should be
a little hole under the switch.

00:02:59.192 --> 00:03:01.872
-WOODY: Little hole, got it!
-"To reset your Buzz Lightyear,

00:03:01.992 --> 00:03:04.032
-"insert paperclip..."
-Rex, use your finger!

00:03:04.152 --> 00:03:05.792
-What?
-(GRUNTING)

00:03:05.872 --> 00:03:07.552
-Okay, now what?
-All right, let's see.

00:03:07.672 --> 00:03:10.632
"Caution. Do not hold button
for more than five seconds."

00:03:10.712 --> 00:03:12.192
(ELECTRONIC TOOTING)

00:03:13.872 --> 00:03:15.192
It's not my fault!

00:03:16.712 --> 00:03:18.232
(CLICKING)

00:03:20.152 --> 00:03:21.232
(IN SPANISH)

00:03:24.952 --> 00:03:27.312
-Now what did you do?
-I just did what you told me!

00:03:27.392 --> 00:03:28.552
(CONTINUES IN SPANISH)

00:03:34.872 --> 00:03:37.072
Uh... Amigos! We're all amigos.

00:03:44.592 --> 00:03:45.832
We gotta switch him back.

00:03:45.912 --> 00:03:48.832
-Well, how do we do that?
-I don't know. That part's in Spanish.

00:03:48.912 --> 00:03:49.992
(TOY SIREN WAILING OUTSIDE)

00:03:50.072 --> 00:03:51.832
We don't have time for this.
Come on, El Buzzo.

00:03:51.912 --> 00:03:52.912
(IN SPANISH)

00:03:56.072 --> 00:03:57.592
CHATTER TELEPHONE:
Good luck, cowboy.

00:04:03.112 --> 00:04:04.832
(GASPS) Here they come.

00:04:07.272 --> 00:04:08.752
Come on, Buzz!

00:04:10.592 --> 00:04:12.032
What took you so long?

00:04:12.112 --> 00:04:14.352
Things got complicated.
Where's Potato Head?

00:04:14.432 --> 00:04:15.872
We haven't seen him.

00:04:15.952 --> 00:04:17.032
(GASPS)

00:04:18.352 --> 00:04:19.432
Buzz.

00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:22.632
(IN SPANISH)

00:04:28.632 --> 00:04:30.032
Did you fix Buzz?

00:04:30.392 --> 00:04:32.272
-Uh, sort of.
-Behind you.

00:04:32.632 --> 00:04:33.912
Someone's coming.

00:04:37.472 --> 00:04:40.472
You would not believe
what I've been through tonight.

00:04:40.552 --> 00:04:42.232
Darling! Are you okay?

00:04:42.312 --> 00:04:44.872
I feel fresh. Healthy. It's terrible.

00:04:44.952 --> 00:04:48.072
You've lost weight. And so tall.

00:04:49.432 --> 00:04:51.712
Ah! You're a sight for detachable eyes.

00:04:57.752 --> 00:04:58.792
All clear.

00:05:02.392 --> 00:05:03.952
Come on. Come on.

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:07.112
We're almost there.

00:05:10.272 --> 00:05:11.312
(GASPS)

00:05:11.912 --> 00:05:13.152
(WHISPERING) Back up. Back up!

00:05:14.672 --> 00:05:15.672
(GASPS)

00:05:16.232 --> 00:05:17.352
(MOUTHING)

00:05:19.912 --> 00:05:21.112
Come on.

00:05:38.952 --> 00:05:40.112
(SQUEAKS)

00:05:45.352 --> 00:05:46.472
(GASPS)

00:06:01.472 --> 00:06:02.632
(BABBLES)

00:06:07.032 --> 00:06:08.152
(SIGHING IN RELIEF)

00:06:08.312 --> 00:06:10.232
(FLAMENCO MUSIC PLAYING)

